`CFSGOutside.HallPaige.Sporadic.Co3Data.cert` is checked by the kernel, in pieces; with the corpus bound
`Nat.card Co3.Group ≤ 495766656000` it identifies the subgroup generated by the certificate's
stabilizer elements with the full point stabilizer (`CFSGOutside.HallPaige.PermKit.permLabelling_of_certOK`).
-/

